| `commit subject history` | `tests/integration/test_work_trailers.py` judges every non-merge subject after the adoption boundary with the message-file matcher. | `pytest tests/integration/test_work_trailers.py` | [`commit_subject.adoption_boundary`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Merge subjects are counted separately and not judged. An off-history boundary fails closed. A zero-commit range is refused. Trailer absence grants no exemption. | [Deterministic checks](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
